## Advantages of Ansible

### Easy to Learn

Ansible uses YAML, which is simple and human-readable.

### Agentless

No additional software installation is required on target servers.

### Open Source

Free to use and supported by a large community.

### Scalable

Can manage small environments as well as thousands of servers.

### Secure

Uses SSH for communication, providing secure access to managed systems.

### Reusable

Playbooks can be reused across different environments.

