## Typical Ansible Workflow

```text
Install Ansible on Control Node
            ↓
Create Inventory File
            ↓
Configure SSH Connectivity
            ↓
Create Playbook
            ↓
Execute Playbook
            ↓
Ansible Connects to Target Nodes
            ↓
Tasks Are Executed
            ↓
Results Are Displayed
```

